abstract: >-
  VMC-QF is a self-contained theoretical vault constructing emergent
  spacetime structure — metric, causality, and particles — from a discrete
  graph of finite-dimensional quantum microcavities with intrinsic cadence
  time. Four core axioms define the substrate, quantization, balance law,
  and cadence phase-leak; a five-around-one geometric frustration
  (angular deficit δθ = 7.356103°) anchors topological soliton formation;
  scale-bridge documents carry the dynamics to mesoscopic effective
  equations and phase hydrodynamics. All results are model-level with
  explicit falsification criteria; no empirical claim is made.
